  "body": "Although [`BluetoothAdvertisingEvent`](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#bluetoothadvertisingevent) includes an `rssi` field, the UA can also get a received signal strength from the latest packet in a connection. We should look into exposing the most recent signal strength on [`BluetoothDevice`](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#bluetoothdevice), maybe along with the time it was measured.\n",
